          <fr:mainmatter><html:p><html:strong style="font-family: var(--serif); font-weight: 400; font-style: italic;">Overview.</html:strong></html:p><html:ul><html:li>Dispatch / Cache: caches compilation based on input argument signatures i.e. shapes, dtypes, sharding. If shapes change will need to <html:strong>recompile</html:strong>.</html:li>
  <html:li>XLA transformation: Python -&gt; JaxPR -&gt; StableHLO, performing fusion and other simplifications to reduce memory overhead (?).</html:li>
  <html:li>TPU specific: Further reduced to LLO IR, then <html:em>very large instruction word</html:em> (VLIW) scheduling to map dot products to MXU.</html:li></html:ul>
