  <html:li>Tiling: arrays are split into smaller blocks to fit into VREG. Want to arrange data to efficiently fit VREG.</html:li></html:ul><html:figure><html:img width="60%" src="/bafkrmihanbz63fc3hvqd3drtqlm5shhn2624xbut2oobs3zibpwjw2jiju.png" />
